### Scope of Coverage & Definition of Software
This license applies to all files, directories, and materials contained within this repository, including but not limited to:
* All software, source code, microservices, and scripts.
* All Infrastructure as Code (IaC), Ansible playbooks, roles, and inventory.
* All Kubernetes manifests, Helm values, Longhorn configurations, and network policies.
* All documentation, architectural blueprints, System Design Descriptions (SDD), engineering specifications, RF airtime models, and storage capacity analyses.

Throughout this license, the terms "software", "work", and "any part of it" expressly encompass all such code, manifests, architecture diagrams, data models, specifications, and documentation.

